# A Digital Binomial Theorem

**Authors:** Hieu D. Nguyen

## Summary
We present a triangle of connections between the Sierpinski triangle, the sum-of-digits function, and the Binomial Theorem via a one-parameter family of Sierpinski matrices, which encodes a digital version of the Binomial Theorem.


